{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322409001:0":{"text":"最愛の妻を捨ててでも、あなたについていきます……","source_cn":"我愿意抛下自己最爱的妻子薇拉，来追随您的脚步……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B3C5865777DB7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322409002:1":{"text":"奥さんを置いてきたのは彼みたいですね。まったく邪教は……有害にもほどがあります！","source_cn":"丢下妻子离开的就是他吧，这些乱七八糟的邪教真是太害人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7248BEA343A4904C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322409003:1":{"text":"さあ、ついてきなさい！偉大なる意志はすぐそこに！","source_cn":"跟上来，跟我们走！伟大意志就在前方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB30D6BE029B4D7D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322409004:1":{"text":"お導きのとおり……","source_cn":"谨遵您的指引……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x585DBDCA82DCCD84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民伊尔":{"text":"町民のイル","source":"镇民伊尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}